 Part 2.

  A specification of experimentally based turbulent viscosities and
turbulent length scales in the bulk of the flow. The values beyond
3.0 diameters were obtained from a k-e solution in that region.

  To obtain a value at any arbitary point use bilinear interpolation
between the four surrounding points. The (FORTRAN) format used to read
these numbers should be: 4E13.3

